---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import FooterScripts from '../../../components/FooterScripts.astro';
import SrkrHeader from '../../../components/SrkrHeader.astro';
import SrkrFooter from '../../../components/SrkrFooter.astro';
import OffCanvas from '../../../components/OffCanvas.astro';
import DeptNav from '../../../components/DeptNav.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Department of Civil Engineering | SRKR Engineering College" description="Department of Civil Engineering at SRKR Engineering College, Bhimavaram — established 1980, NBA accredited." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/banner/breadcrumb.jpg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Civil Engineering</li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">Department of Civil Engineering</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB AREA END -->

    <!-- content -->
    <div class="rts-faculty-details py-5">
      <div class="container">

        <DeptNav dept="civil" current="Home" />

        <!-- About the Department -->
        <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center mb-5 pb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="faculty-content-text me-5">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-5">About the Department</h3>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The Department of Civil Engineering at SRKR Engineering College was established in 1980 and has grown into one of the leading centres for civil engineering education and applied research in Andhra Pradesh, especially in the coastal region. The department offers both B.Tech. in Civil Engineering and M.Tech. in Structural Engineering programs.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Its undergraduate program has been accredited four times by the National Board of Accreditation — for the periods 2002–2007, 2007–2012, 2020–2023, and 2023–2026 — reflecting its sustained commitment to quality technical education. The department has consistently produced graduates with strong technical expertise, communication abilities, and professional values.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The department adopts innovative teaching practices including classroom teaching, seminars, presentations, video lectures, MOOC platforms, honours/minor programs, experiential learning, and online sessions by internal and external experts. Students are trained in modern industry-relevant software such as STAAD.Pro, REVIT, and other structural design tools through specialised workshops, and benefit from full-semester internships at reputed organisations across India.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The department is also a major contributor to consultancy services in Structural, Geotechnical, Transportation, and Environmental Engineering, generating over 80% of the institution's consultancy revenue. Recognised as a research centre by Andhra University and JNTUK, it actively promotes research through six Centres of Excellence focused on water quality, advanced materials, and environmental sustainability.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zWHp1cRW8fc?html5=1&enablejsapi=1"
                title="SRKR Department Video"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Message from HoD -->
        <div class="row mt--30">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Message from Head of Department</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-8">
            <div class="faculty-image text-center">
              <img class="img-fluid mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/civil/550.jpg" alt="Dr. P. Poluraju">
              <div class="h5 mb-2 mt-5">Dr.G.Sri Bala</div>
              <span>Associate Professor &amp; Head of Department</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text ms-lg-5 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Welcome to the Department of Civil Engineering</p>
              <p class="mb-5">The Department of Civil Engineering at SRKR Engineering College has been a cornerstone of quality engineering education since its establishment in 1980. Over four decades, we have built a legacy of academic excellence, research impact, and industry-ready graduates who are contributing to nation-building across the country and beyond.</p>
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Education Rooted in Practice</p>
              <p class="mb-5">Our programmes combine rigorous theoretical foundations with hands-on learning through twelve well-equipped laboratories and six Centres of Excellence. Students gain exposure to industry-standard tools such as STAAD.Pro, REVIT, and AutoCAD, and participate in full-semester internships that bridge the gap between classroom and construction site.</p>
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Research and Community Service</p>
              <p>The department is recognised as a Research Centre by both Andhra University and JNTUK. Our faculty and students actively contribute to funded research projects and consultancy assignments — generating over 80% of the institution's consultancy revenue — while addressing real infrastructure challenges faced by society. I warmly invite you to explore everything this department has to offer and look forward to welcoming you into our community.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-top my-60"></div>

          <!-- Mission & Vision -->
          <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list me-5">

                <h4 class="font-32 mb-3 mt-4">Vision</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list mb-0">
                  <li class="mb-3">To be a globally recognised centre of excellence in Civil Engineering education and research.</li>
                  <li>To develop competent engineers who contribute to sustainable infrastructure and societal development.</li>
                </ul>

                <h4 class="font-32 mb-4">Mission</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list">
                  <li class="mb-3">To provide high quality education and make the students ethical, world-class professionals.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To improve the skills of both staff and students through research projects and consultancy.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To inculcate a sense of societal responsibility and evoke commitment to serve communities better.</li>
                </ul>
                
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
              <figure class="mt-5 mt-lg-0">
                <img class="mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/civil/civilhome.jpeg" alt="Civil Engineering Lab" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </figure>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Specializations -->
        <div class="row g-5 faculty-sub-details rts-section-padding">
          <div class="rts-section mb-4 text-center">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Core Specializations</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">

                <img src="/assets/images/faculty/civil/Structuralengineering.png?w=600&h=380&fit=crop" alt="Structural Engineering" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/">Structural Engineering</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/faculty/civil/Geotechnicalengineering.png?w=600&h=380&fit=crop" alt="Geotechnical Engineering" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/">Geotechnical Engineering</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/faculty/civil/Transportationengineering.png?w=600&h=380&fit=crop" alt="Transportation Engineering" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/">Transportation Engineering</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/faculty/civil/EnvironmentalEngineering.png?w=600&h=380&fit=crop" alt="Environmental Engineering" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/">Environmental Engineering</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Academics & Programs -->
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center g-0">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60 text-center">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Academics &amp; Programs</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Undergraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">B.Tech Civil Engineering
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">4-Year JNTUK Affiliated
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">NBA Accredited (4×)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Industry-Integrated Curriculum
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item v__2">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Postgraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">M.Tech Structural Engineering
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">2-Year JNTUK Affiliated
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Advanced Design Studios
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Research &amp; Thesis Track
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Research</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Ph.D. Programs (JNTUK &amp; AU)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">6 Centres of Excellence
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">DST &amp; VGST Funded Projects
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">150+ SCI/Scopus Publications
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- content end -->

    <!-- Department Highlights -->
    <div class="rts-blog v_1 rts__light rts-section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
          <div class="col-md-11 col-lg-12">
            <div class="rts-section rts-border-bottom-1 mb--50 pb--20">
              <h2 class="rts-section-title text-uppercase">Department Highlights</h2>
              <p class="rts-section-description">Four decades of excellence in education, research, and industry partnerships.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-5 justify-content-md-center">
          <div class="col-md-11 col-lg-6">
            <div class="rts-blog-post blog-v-full">
              <div class="single-blog-post">
                <a href="/departments/civil/achievements/" class="blog-thumb">
                  <img src="/assets/images/blog/big-thumb-1.jpg" alt="NBA Accreditation" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                </a>
                <div class="blog-content">
                  <div class="post-meta">
                    <div class="rt-author">
                      <span><i class="fa-light fa-award"></i></span>
                      <a href="#">Accreditation</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rt-date">
                      <span><i class="fal fa-calendar"></i></span>
                      <span>NBA Accredited 4 Times</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <a href="/departments/civil/achievements/" class="post-title">
                    NBA-accredited four times — a mark of sustained academic quality.
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-11 col-lg-6">
            <div class="rts-blog-post">
              <div class="single-blog-post">
                <div class="blog-thumb">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/">
                    <img src="/assets/images/blog/small-thumb-1.jpg" alt="Research Centres" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                  </a>
                </div>
                <div class="blog-content">
                  <div class="post-meta">
                    <div class="rt-author">
                      <span><i class="fa-light fa-flask"></i></span>
                      <a href="#">Research</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rt-date">
                      <span><i class="fal fa-calendar"></i></span>
                      <span>Recognised Research Centre</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <a href="/departments/civil/research-consultancy/" class="post-title">
                    Six Centres of Excellence, recognised by Andhra University and JNTUK.
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="single-blog-post">
                <div class="blog-thumb">
                  <a href="/departments/civil/placements/">
                    <img src="/assets/images/blog/small-thumb-2.jpg" alt="Placements" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                  </a>
                </div>
                <div class="blog-content">
                  <div class="post-meta">
                    <div class="rt-author">
